# wear/woman/smock_hang: the smock's skirt to the knee: loose folds, a lit hem band (the edge region) and its outline row, the
# rope belt's tail; it swings by whole rows (sway), widens on the stride and flares in the run
# GARB-W (P2b wave 2). Fitted to one body (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role garment smock
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
sway 3

